{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"反复加力无果、身体先于念头松动以及问题仍未消失，都有H6、H8、H12、H18、H20和M1支撑，没有新增事件，也没有把音乐变化直接当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"祈求与旧家园被写成对既有亲近、愿望和不可保证性的比喻性表达，心理因果仍落在克制、思念与无法重新握回过去的矛盾上，没有落实为新的身份或真实往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"靠近愿望逐渐显现、意识到此刻正在过去以及激动带来消耗，都接在H2、H17、H18、H20和M33、M38已经确立的历史上，属于允许的局部心理因果桥，而非新增说话事件或以音乐变化解释心理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"从抓取转向轻放，是对H18、H19、H20和M5所确立的珍惜不等于控制、愿望不等于保证的进一步说明，没有把放轻抓取改写成放弃，也没有改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了从既有的牵挂、反复加力和无法保证，到当下具体心理状态的因果联系，因此即使拿掉听感记录，也能独立读懂人物的情绪变化及其内在逻辑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4ea88ac7-c978-4c4b-b9d3-de7170faaffb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135332348515Z", "elapsed_seconds": 211.594, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:57:03.941207+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3a3fc3f07af7b820a8981e9f2726e65b0e06270b5c5baa613f9bec578a3ee130", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retr